  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You are amongst the strongest of your own phalanx, or the most prominent draichsar amongst the people you consider your community. Should a patron or matron pass without another in line, you are most likely to be selected to lead the phalanx in their stead; for your powers have grown to encompass all the qualities of your Drachiri Benefactor.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">When you take this feat, you gain all the traits of your Drachiri Benefactor for this ancestry and gain a +2 circumstance bonus to saving throws against effects with those traits. For each trait you already have, you ignore a target’s resistance to that element. During your turn, you can change your attuned element as a free action.</span></p>"
